{"id":"msg-1770080977986-znpz5f","type":"tool","content":"     1→{\n     2→  \"name\": \"stacks-ai\",\n     3→  \"version\": \"0.2.9\",\n     4→  \"description\": \"Stacks - AI-powered infinite canvas for notes, images, and creative organization\",\n     5→  \"author\": \"Jason Kneen\",\n     6→  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n     7→  \"type\": \"module\",\n     8→  \"main\": \"electron/main.cjs\",\n     9→  \"bin\": {\n    10→    \"stacks-ai\": \"bin/stacks.cjs\"\n    11→  },\n    12→  \"files\": [\n    13→    \"bin/\",\n    14→    \"dist/assets/\",\n    15→    \"dist/fonts/\",\n    16→    \"dist/index.html\",\n    17→    \"dist/mcp/*.js\",\n    18→    \"electron/\",\n    19→    \"assets/icon.icns\",\n    20→    \"README.md\"\n    21→  ],\n    22→  \"scripts\": {\n    23→    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    24→    \"build\": \"vite build && npm run mcp:build\",\n    25→    \"build:prod\": \"npm run clean && NODE_ENV=production vite build && npm run mcp:build\",\n    26→    \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n    27→    \"clean\": \"rm -rf dist node_modules/.vite\",\n    28→    \"electron\": \"electron .\",\n    29→    \"electron:dev\": \"NODE_ENV=development electron .\",\n    30→    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build:prod\",\n    31→    \"mcp:dev\": \"tsx watch mcp/server.ts\",\n    32→    \"mcp:build\": \"tsc -p tsconfig.mcp.json\",\n    33→    \"mcp:start\": \"node dist/mcp/server.js\",\n    34→    \"mcp:proxy\": \"tsx mcp/proxy.ts\",\n    35→    \"mcp:proxy:start\": \"node dist/mcp/proxy.js\",\n    36→    \"version:patch\": \"npm version patch --no-git-tag-version\",\n    37→    \"version:minor\": \"npm version minor --no-git-tag-version\",\n    38→    \"version:major\": \"npm version major --no-git-tag-version\",\n    39→    \"package:mac\": \"bun run build:prod && electron-builder --mac --config\"\n    40→  },\n    41→  \"build\": {\n    42→    \"appId\": \"com.jasonkneen.stacks\",\n    43→    \"productName\": \"Stacks\",\n    44→    \"directories\": {\n    45→      \"output\": \"release\",\n    46→      \"buildResources\": \"build\"\n    47→    },\n    48→    \"files\": [\n    49→      \"dist/**/*\",\n    50→      \"electron/**/*\",\n    51→      \"assets/**/*\",\n    52→      \"node_modules/**/*\",\n    53→      \"!node_modules/.vite/**/*\",\n    54→      \"!node_modules/tsx/**/*\",\n    55→      \"!node_modules/@esbuild/**/*\",\n    56→      \"!node_modules/esbuild/**/*\",\n    57→      \"!node_modules/vite/**/*\",\n    58→      \"!node_modules/@vitejs/**/*\",\n    59→      \"!node_modules/typescript/**/*\",\n    60→      \"!node_modules/tailwindcss/**/*\",\n    61→      \"!node_modules/@tailwindcss/**/*\",\n    62→      \"!node_modules/postcss/**/*\",\n    63→      \"!node_modules/autoprefixer/**/*\"\n    64→    ],\n    65→    \"mac\": {\n    66→      \"category\": \"public.app-category.productivity\",\n    67→      \"icon\": \"assets/icon.icns\",\n    68→      \"hardenedRuntime\": true,\n    69→      \"gatekeeperAssess\": false,\n    70→      \"entitlements\": \"build/entitlements.mac.plist\",\n    71→      \"entitlementsInherit\": \"build/entitlements.mac.inherit.plist\",\n    72→      \"target\": [\n    73→        {\n    74→          \"target\": \"dmg\",\n    75→          \"arch\": [\"arm64\", \"x64\"]\n    76→        }\n    77→      ]\n    78→    },\n    79→    \"dmg\": {\n    80→      \"sign\": false\n    81→    }\n    82→  },\n    83→  \"dependencies\": {\n    84→    \"@ai-sdk/anthropic\": \"^3.0.2\",\n    85→    \"@ai-sdk/google\": \"^3.0.2\",\n    86→    \"@ai-sdk/openai\": \"^3.0.2\",\n    87→    \"@anthropic-ai/sdk\": \"^0.71.2\",\n    88→    \"@google/genai\": \"^1.34.0\",\n    89→    \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk\": \"^1.25.1\",\n    90→    \"@paper-design/shaders-react\": \"^0.0.68\",\n    91→    \"@types/better-sqlite3\": \"^7.6.13\",\n    92→    \"ai\": \"^6.0.6\",\n    93→    \"better-sqlite3\": \"^12.5.0\",\n    94→    \"elkjs\": \"0.9.3\",\n    95→    \"ghostty-web\": \"^0.4.0\",\n    96→    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.562.0\",\n    97→    \"node-pty\": \"^1.1.0\",\n    98→    \"openai\": \"^6.15.0\",\n    99→    \"react\": \"^19.2.3\",\n   100→    \"react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\",\n   101→    \"tsx\": \"^4.21.0\",\n   102→    \"ws\": \"^8.19.0\",\n   103→    \"zod\": \"^4.3.5\"\n   104→  },\n   105→  \"devDependencies\": {\n   106→    \"@tailwindcss/postcss\": \"^4.1.18\",\n   107→    \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"^4.1.18\",\n   108→    \"@types/node\": \"^22.14.0\",\n   109→    \"@types/ws\": \"^8.18.1\",\n   110→    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"^5.0.0\",\n   111→    \"autoprefixer\": \"^10.4.23\",\n   112→    \"electron\": \"^39.2.7\",\n   113→    \"electron-builder\": \"^26.4.0\",\n   114→    \"postcss\": \"^8.5.6\",\n   115→    \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.1.18\",\n   116→    \"typescript\": \"~5.8.2\",\n   117→    \"vite\": \"^6.2.0\",\n   118→    \"web-worker\": \"^1.5.0\"\n   119→  },\n   120→  \"repository\": {\n   121→    \"type\": \"git\",\n   122→    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/jasonkneen/stacks.git\"\n   123→  },\n   124→  \"keywords\": [\n   125→    \"stacks\",\n   126→    \"canvas\",\n   127→    \"notes\",\n   128→    \"ai\",\n   129→    \"workspace\",\n   130→    \"electron\",\n   131→    \"infinite-canvas\"\n   132→  ]\n   133→}\n   134→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n","timestamp":1770080977986,"toolName":"Read","toolUseId":"toolu_01MsetBMkCYZTuNKTXSvfNus","toolInput":{"file_path":"/Users/jkneen/Documents/GitHub/spatial/package.json"},"toolResult":"     1→{\n     2→  \"name\": \"stacks-ai\",\n     3→  \"version\": \"0.2.9\",\n     4→  \"description\": \"Stacks - AI-powered infinite canvas for notes, images, and creative organization\",\n     5→  \"author\": \"Jason Kneen\",\n     6→  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n     7→  \"type\": \"module\",\n     8→  \"main\": \"electron/main.cjs\",\n     9→  \"bin\": {\n    10→    \"stacks-ai\": \"bin/stacks.cjs\"\n    11→  },\n    12→  \"files\": [\n    13→    \"bin/\",\n    14→    \"dist/assets/\",\n    15→    \"dist/fonts/\",\n    16→    \"dist/index.html\",\n    17→    \"dist/mcp/*.js\",\n    18→    \"electron/\",\n    19→    \"assets/icon.icns\",\n    20→    \"README.md\"\n    21→  ],\n    22→  \"scripts\": {\n    23→    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    24→    \"build\": \"vite build && npm run mcp:build\",\n    25→    \"build:prod\": \"npm run clean && NODE_ENV=production vite build && npm run mcp:build\",\n    26→    \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n    27→    \"clean\": \"rm -rf dist node_modules/.vite\",\n    28→    \"electron\": \"electron .\",\n    29→    \"electron:dev\": \"NODE_ENV=development electron .\",\n    30→    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build:prod\",\n    31→    \"mcp:dev\": \"tsx watch mcp/server.ts\",\n    32→    \"mcp:build\": \"tsc -p tsconfig.mcp.json\",\n    33→    \"mcp:start\": \"node dist/mcp/server.js\",\n    34→    \"mcp:proxy\": \"tsx mcp/proxy.ts\",\n    35→    \"mcp:proxy:start\": \"node dist/mcp/proxy.js\",\n    36→    \"version:patch\": \"npm version patch --no-git-tag-version\",\n    37→    \"version:minor\": \"npm version minor --no-git-tag-version\",\n    38→    \"version:major\": \"npm version major --no-git-tag-version\",\n    39→    \"package:mac\": \"bun run build:prod && electron-builder --mac --config\"\n    40→  },\n    41→  \"build\": {\n    42→    \"appId\": \"com.jasonkneen.stacks\",\n    43→    \"productName\": \"Stacks\",\n    44→    \"directories\": {\n    45→      \"output\": \"release\",\n    46→      \"buildResources\": \"build\"\n    47→    },\n    48→    \"files\": [\n    49→      \"dist/**/*\",\n    50→      \"electron/**/*\",\n    51→      \"assets/**/*\",\n    52→      \"node_modules/**/*\",\n    53→      \"!node_modules/.vite/**/*\",\n    54→      