endencies\": {\n   106→    \"@tailwindcss/postcss\": \"^4.1.18\",\n   107→    \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"^4.1.18\",\n   108→    \"@types/node\": \"^22.14.0\",\n   109→    \"@types/ws\": \"^8.18.1\",\n   110→    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"^5.0.0\",\n   111→    \"autoprefixer\": \"^10.4.23\",\n   112→    \"electron\": \"^39.2.7\",\n   113→    \"electron-builder\": \"^26.4.0\",\n   114→    \"postcss\": \"^8.5.6\",\n   115→    \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.1.18\",\n   116→    \"typescript\": \"~5.8.2\",\n   117→    \"vite\": \"^6.2.0\",\n   118→    \"web-worker\": \"^1.5.0\"\n   119→  },\n   120→  \"repository\": {\n   121→    \"type\": \"git\",\n   122→    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/jasonkneen/stacks.git\"\n   123→  },\n   124→  \"keywords\": [\n   125→    \"stacks\",\n   126→    \"canvas\",\n   127→    \"notes\",\n   128→    \"ai\",\n   129→    \"workspace\",\n   130→    \"electron\",\n   131→    \"infinite-canvas\"\n   132→  ]\n   133→}\n   134→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n","toolStatus":"completed","toolDisplayMeta":{"displayName":"Read","category":"native"},"isError":false,"turnId":"msg_019ygscqHvzpqAr79iV7SXva"}
{"id":"msg-1770080978344-eslbpn","type":"assistant","content":"I'll conduct a comprehensive code review of your project. Let me start by understanding the codebase structure and reading any available project context.","timestamp":1770080978344,"isIntermediate":true,"turnId":"msg_019ygscqHvzpqAr79iV7SXva"}
{"id":"msg-1770080984209-7nyvx2","type":"tool","content":"[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"text\": \"Perfect! Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the codebase. Let me create a detailed overview document:\\n\\n## Comprehensive Stacks Codebase Overview\\n\\nI've thoroughly explored the Stacks project architecture. Here's a complete breakdown of the codebase structure:\\n\\n### 1. **Overall Architecture**\\n\\nStacks is a sophisticated three-layer application:\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│               Electron Main Process                      │\\n│  (electron/main.cjs, pty-server.cjs, mcp-proxy.cjs)    │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│          React Frontend (Vite + Tailwind)               │\\n│  (App.tsx, components/, hooks/, utils/)                │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│  MCP Server + Proxy + WebSocket Bridges                 │\\n│  (mcp/server.ts, mcp/proxy.ts, node-pty)               │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│         Storage Layer (SQLite + IndexedDB)              │\\n│  (utils/storage.ts, utils/indexedDB.ts)                │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n### 2. **Technology Stack**\\n\\n**Core Technologies:**\\n- **Electron v39.2.7** - Desktop application framework\\n- **React 19.2.3** - UI framework\\n- **Vite 6.2.0** - Build tool and dev server\\n- **TypeScript ~5.8.2** - Language with full strict mode\\n- **Tailwind CSS 4.1.18** - Styling with PostCSS integration\\n\\n**AI & MCP:**\\n- **@modelcontextprotocol/sdk ^1.25.1** - Model Context Protocol\\n- **@ai-sdk/anthropic, @openai, @google** - Multi-provider AI support\\n- **@anthropic-ai/sdk, openai, @google/genai** - Direct API clients\\n\\n**Database & Storage:**\\n- **better-sqlite3 ^12.5.0** - Local SQLite database\\n- **IndexedDB** - Browser-based media storage\\n- **localStorage** - State persistence\\n\\n**Terminal & PTY:**\\n- **node-pty ^1.1.0** - Pseudo-terminal emulation\\n- **ghostty-web ^0.4.0** - Ghostty terminal integration\\n- **ws ^8.19.0** - WebSocket server for PTY\\n\\n**Other Libraries:**\\n- **elkjs 0.9.3** - Graph layout engine for auto-arrange\\n- **lucide-react ^0.562.0** - Icon library\\n- **zod ^4.3.5** - Schema validation\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. **Directory Structure & Key Files**\\n\\n```\\n/spatial\\n├── App.tsx                          # Root component (25k+ lines)\\n├── index.tsx                        # React entry point\\n├── types.ts                         # TypeScript interfaces & types\\n├── vite.config.ts                   # Vite build configuration\\n│\\n├── bin/\\n│   └── stacks.cjs                  # CLI launcher script (384 lines)\\n│                                   # - Auto-downloads Electron\\n│                                   # - Manages MCP proxy startup\\n│                                   # - Version checking & updates\\n│\\n├── electron/\\n│   ├── main.cjs                    # Electron main process (200+ lines)\\n│   │                               # - Handles app lifecycle\\n│   │                               # - Vite dev server integration\\n│   │                               # - Window management\\n│   ├── mcp-proxy.cjs               # MCP proxy server (embedded)\\n│   │                               # - WebSocket bridge\\n│   │                               # - stdio MCP server management\\n│   │                               # - Server config persistence\\n│   └── pty-server.cjs              # PTY WebSocket server\\n│                                   # - Terminal emulation\\n│                                   # - Shell spawning\\n│\\n├── mcp/\\n│   ├── server.ts                   # MCP server implementation\\n│   │                               # - SQLite database interface\\n│   │                               # - Space/item CRUD tools\\n│   │                               # - Better-sqlite3 binding\\n│   └── proxy.ts                    # TypeScript MCP proxy\\n│                                   # - WebSocket handling\\n│                                   # - Server lifecycle\\n│                                   # - Tool/resource management\\n│\\n├── components/\\n│   ├── Canvas.tsx                  # Main canvas renderer\\n│   │                               # - Infinite pan/zoom\\n│   │                               # - Item selection & manipulation\\n│   │                               # - Connection rendering\\n│   ├── ItemRenderer.tsx            # Item rendering system\\n│   ├── NoteComponent.tsx           # Note editor\\n│   ├── StickyComponent.tsx         # Sticky note widget\\n│   ├── MediaComponent.tsx          # Image/video viewer\\n│   ├── FolderComponent.tsx         # Folder navigation\\n│   ├── BrowserComponent.tsx        # Embedded browser\\n│   ├── GhosttyComponent.tsx        # Terminal with Ghostty\\n│   ├── ContextToolbar.tsx          # Context menu system\\n│   ├── AIChat.tsx                  # AI conversation interface\\n│   ├── AIModal.tsx                 # AI response modal\\n│   ├── AIPromptPopup.tsx           # Inline AI prompt\\n│   ├── QuickGenerate.tsx           # Quick AI generation\\n│   ├── AutoArrangeButton.tsx       # Layout automation\\n│   ├── SettingsModal.tsx           # User preferences\\n│   ├── SearchModal.tsx             # Full-text search\\n│   ├── MediaViewer.tsx             # Media preview\\n│   ├── NoteViewer.tsx              # Note detail view\\n│   ├── SpaceOverview.tsx           # Space navigation tree\\n│   ├── ErrorBoundary.tsx           # Error handling\\n│   ├── Toolbar.tsx                 # Top toolbar\\n│   ├── SpaceToolbar.tsx            # Space-specific tools\\n│   ├── NameEditor.tsx              # Inline name editing\\n│   └── SpaceIndicator.tsx          # Current space display\\n│\\n├── hooks/\\n│   ├── useMCPClient.ts             # MCP client connection\\n│   │                               # - WebSocket management\\n│   │                               # - Server listing\\n│   │                               # - Tool invocation\\n│   ├── useAIWithTools.ts           # AI + tool integration\\n│   ├── useAutoSave.ts              # Auto-save persistence\\n│   ├── useSpaces.ts                # Space state management\\n│   └── useContentZoom.ts           # Content zoom hook\\n│\\n├── utils/\\n│   ├── storage.ts                  # Spaces persistence\\n│   │                               # - localStorage for metadata\\n│   │                               # - IndexedDB for media\\n│   ├── indexedDB.ts                # IndexedDB wrapper\\n│   │                               # - Media storage\\n│   │                               # - Blob handling\\n│   ├── layouts.ts                  # Auto-arrange algorithms\\n│   │                               # - Grid, Bento, Random layouts\\n│   │                               # - ELK graph layout\\n│   ├── database.ts                 # Database utilities\\n│   ├── imageAnalysis.ts            # Image processing\\n│   │                               # - Vision API integration\\n│   ├── imageGeneration.ts          # Image generation\\n│   ├── visionAnalysis.ts           # Vision analysis tools\\n│   ├── aiProvider.ts               # AI provider abstraction\\n│   │                               # - Supports Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini\\n│   ├── gemini.ts                   # Gemini-specific integration\\n│   └── exifExtractor.ts            # EXIF metadata extraction\\n│\\n├── lib/\\n│   └── mediaStorage.ts             # Media file handling\\n│                                   # - File storage system\\n│                                   # - Media ID generation\\n│\\n├── src/\\n│   ├── index.css                   # Global styles with Tailwind\\n│   │                               # - Custom animations\\n│   │                               # - Typography settings\\n│   └── electron.d.ts               # Electron type definitions\\n│\\n└── dist/                           # Built application\\n    ├── index.html\\n    ├── mcp/server.js               # Compiled MCP server\\n    └── mcp/proxy.js                # Compiled proxy\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. **Core Data Types** (types.ts)\\n\\n```typescript\\ntype ItemType = 'sticky' | 'note' | 'image' | 'video' | 'folder' | 'browser' | 'terminal'\\ntype LayoutType = 'grid' | 'bento' | 'random' | 'free'\\ntype SortOption = 'updated' | 'added' | 'name' | 'type'\\ntype FlowDirection = 'horizontal' | 'vertical'\\ntype ItemSpacing = 'compact' | 'comfortable' | 'spacious'\\n\\ninterface SpatialItem {\\n  id, type, x, y, w, h, zIndex, rotation\\n  content, color, metadata, linkedSpaceId\\n}\\n\\ninterface Space {\\n  id, name, parentId\\n  items, connections, camera\\n  layoutType, sortBy, flowDirection, itemSpacing\\n}\\n\\ninterface Connection {\\n  id, from, to\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 5. **Key Components & Features**\\n\\n#### **Canvas System** (Canvas.tsx + ItemRenderer.tsx)\\n- Infinite pan/zoom with mouse wheel\\n- Multi-select with Cmd+A\\n- Drag-and-drop repositioning\\n- Connection drawing between items\\n- Grid-based snapping (togglable)\\n- Item rotation and scaling\\n\\n#### **Item Types**\\n- **Sticky Notes** - Quick text snippets, customizable colors\\n- **Notes** - Larger text editor with markdown support\\n- **Images** - Image viewer with EXIF extraction\\n- **Videos** - Video player with metadata\\n- **Folders** - Hierarchical space navigation\\n- **Browser** - Embedded web content\\n- **Terminal** - Ghostty terminal with PTY backend\\n\\n#### **AI Integration**\\n- Multi-provider support (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google Gemini)\\n- Vision analysis for images\\n- Image generation capabilities\\n- MCP server bridge for external tools\\n- Contextual AI prompts\\n\\n#### **Auto-Arrange**\\n- Grid layout (220px cells with 40px gaps)\\n- Bento layout (mixed sizes, 3-column)\\n- Random scatter layout\\n- ELK graph-based layout\\n- Configurable spacing (compact/comfortable/spacious)\\n- Sort options (updated/added/name/type)\\n\\n#### **Storage & Persistence**\\n- **IndexedDB** - Media files (images/videos)\\n- **SQLite** (via MCP) - Persistent space data\\n- **localStorage** - UI state and preferences\\n- Auto-save with 5-second debounce\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 6. **MCP (Model Context Protocol) Integration**\\n\\n#### **MCP Server** (mcp/server.ts)\\n- Implements stdio transport\\n- SQLite database for space persistence\\n- Tools available to AI clients:\\n  - `list_spaces` - Enumerate all spaces\\n  - `get_space` - Load space data\\n  - `save_space` - Persist space changes\\n  - `create_space` - New space creation\\n  - `delete_space` - Space removal\\n  - And more...\\n\\n#### **MCP Proxy** (mcp/proxy.ts)\\n- WebSocket server on port 3099\\n- Bridges browser (frontend) to stdio MCP servers\\n- Manages server lifecycle (spawn/kill)\\n- Config persistence in `~/.stacks/mcp-proxy-config.json`\\n- Supports arbitrary external MCP servers\\n\\n#### **MCP Client Hook** (hooks/useMCPClient.ts)\\n- WebSocket connection to proxy (port 3099)\\n- Server listing and connection\\n- Tool invocation interface\\n- Resource and prompt support\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 7. **Electron Integration**\\n\\n#### **Launcher** (bin/stacks.cjs)\\n- Smart Electron caching in `~/.stacks/electron/`\\n- Auto-downloads Electron (~100MB) on first run\\n- Update checking against npm registry\\n- CLI commands: `--help`, `--version`, `--update`, `--clean`\\n- MCP proxy startup before Electron launch\\n- Signal handling (SIGINT, SIGTERM)\\n\\n#### **Main Process** (electron/main.cjs)\\n- Vite dev server management\\n- BrowserWindow creation and lifecycle\\n- PTY server initialization\\n- MCP proxy management\\n- Auto-reload on dev changes\\n\\n#### **PTY Server** (electron/pty-server.cjs)\\n- WebSocket server on port 3100\\n- Node-pty shell spawning\\n- Real-time terminal output streaming\\n- Supports zsh, bash, powershell\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 8. **Build & Deployment**\\n\\n#### **Build Scripts** (package.json)\\n```\\ndev              - Vite dev server (port 3000)\\nbuild            - Vite build + MCP TypeScript compilation\\nbuild:prod       - Production build with NODE_ENV=production\\nmcp:dev          - MCP server with tsx watch\\nmcp:build        - TypeScript compilation for MCP\\npackage:mac      - electron-builder for macOS\\n```\\n\\n#### **Build Output**\\n- React app → `dist/index.html` + assets\\n- MCP server → `dist/mcp/server.js`\\n- Electron → Self-contained macOS app\\n\\n#### **Configuration**\\n- **vite.config.ts** - Vite build (React, Tailwind, path aliases)\\n- **tsconfig.json** - Frontend TypeScript (ES2022, JSX, no emit)\\n- **tsconfig.mcp.json** - MCP server (ES2022, CommonJS output)\\n- **electron-builder config** - macOS/Windows packaging\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 9. **Key Utilities**\\n\\n#### **Storage System** (utils/storage.ts)\\n- `saveSpaces()` - Persists state with media deduplication\\n- `loadSpaces()` - Restores from IndexedDB/localStorage\\n- Media → IndexedDB (images/videos)\\n- Metadata → localStorage\\n\\n#### **Layouts** (utils/layouts.ts)\\n- `sortItems()` - Multi-key sorting\\n- `measureNoteContent()` - Dynamic grid sizing\\n- Layout algorithms using ELK for graph-based arrangements\\n- Constants for sizing and spacing\\n\\n#### **AI Providers** (utils/aiProvider.ts)\\n- Abstraction over multiple AI APIs\\n- Streaming response support\\n- Tool use integration\\n- Model selection logic\\n\\n#### **Image Analysis** (utils/imageAnalysis.ts)\\n- Vision API calls (Google/OpenAI)\\n- Color extraction\\n- Image metadata analysis\\n\\n#### **EXIF Extraction** (utils/exifExtractor.ts)\\n- Image metadata parsing\\n- Video duration detection\\n- Resolution extraction\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 10. **Recent Changes** (from git history)\\n\\n```\\nv0.2.9  - Scale drag tilt and lift by item size\\nv0.2.8  - Ghostty terminal integration with PTY backend\\n         - Add Ghostty terminal integration\\n         - MCP proxy architecture\\n         - Index-based storage system\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 11. **Project Statistics**\\n\\n**Source Code Files:**\\n- 48 TypeScript/TSX files (excluding node_modules)\\n- 27 React components\\n- 5 custom hooks\\n- 10 utility modules\\n- 2 MCP implementations\\n- 3 Electron modules\\n\\n**Key Metrics:**\\n- App.tsx: 25k+ lines (main application)\\n- Package size: ~5MB (with all dependencies)\\n- Runtime cache: ~/.stacks directory\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 12. **Architecture Patterns**\\n\\n1. **Spatial Canvas** - Infinite 2D grid with zoom/pan\\n2. **Hierarchical Spaces** - Folder-like navigation\\n3. **Event-Driven State** - React hooks + callbacks\\n4. **Bridge Architecture** - Electron ↔ Web ↔ MCP\\n5. **Lazy Loading** - Media stored in IndexedDB\\n6. **Auto-Persistence** - Debounced saves to storage\\n7. **Tool Integration** - MCP server for AI extensions\\n\\n---\\n\\nThis comprehensive architecture demonstrates a sophisticated desktop application that combines infinite canvas UI, AI integration, local-first storage, and extensible tool systems through the Model Context Protocol.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"text\": \"agentId: aa1a6b7 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\"\n  }\n]","timestamp":1770080984209,"toolName":"Task","toolUseId":"toolu_018o4mqUbhmcjgKva5tYWCRD","toolInput":{"subagent_type":"Explore","description":"Explore codebase structure","prompt":"Explore the entire codebase structure of this Stacks project. I need to understand:\n1. The overall architecture (Electron + React + MCP server)\n2. Main source files and directories\n3. Key components and modules\n4. Configuration files\n5. Build and deployment setup\n\nPlease provide a comprehensive overview of the codebase organization.","model":"haiku"},"toolResult":"[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"text\": \"Perfect! Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the codebase. Let me create a detailed overview document:\\n\\n## Comprehensive Stacks Codebase Overview\\n\\nI've thoroughly explored the Stacks project architecture. Here's a complete breakdown of the codebase structure:\\n\\n### 1. **Overall Architecture**\\n\\nStacks is a sophisticated three-layer application:\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│               Electron Main Process                      │\\n│  (electron/main.cjs, pty-server.cjs, mcp-proxy.cjs)    │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│          React Frontend (Vite + Tailwind)               │\\n│  (App.tsx, components/, hooks/, utils/)                │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│  MCP Server + Proxy + WebSocket Bridges                 │\\n│  (mcp/server.ts, mcp/proxy.ts, node-pty)               │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│         Storage Layer (SQLite + IndexedDB)              │\\n│  (utils/storage.ts, utils/indexedDB.ts)                │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n### 2. **Technology Stack**\\n\\n**Core Technologies:**\\n- **Electron v39.2.7** - Desktop application framework\\n- **React 19.2.3** - UI framework\\n- **Vite 6.2.0** - Build tool and dev server\\n- **TypeScript ~5.8.2** - Language with full strict mode\\n- **Tailwind CSS 4.1.18** - Styling with PostCSS integration\\n\\n**AI & MCP:**\\n- **@modelcontextprotocol/sdk ^1.25.1** - Model Context Protocol\\n- **@ai-sdk/anthropic, @openai, @google** - Multi-provider AI support\\n- **@anthropic-ai/sdk, openai, @google/genai** - Direct API clients\\n\\n**Database & Storage:**\\n- **better-sqlite3 ^12.5.0** - Local SQLite database\\n- **IndexedDB** - Browser-based media storage\\n- **localStorage** - State persistence\\n\\n**Terminal & PTY:**\\n- **node-pty ^1.1.0** - Pseudo-terminal emulation\\n- **ghostty-web ^0.4.0** - Ghostty terminal integration\\n- **ws ^8.19.0** - WebSocket server for PTY\\n\\n**Other Libraries:**\\n- **elkjs 0.9.3** - Graph layout engine for auto-arrange\\n- **lucide-react ^0.562.0** - Icon library\\n- **zod ^4.3.5** - Schema validation\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. **Directory Structure & Key Files**\\n\\n```\\n/spatial\\n├── App.tsx                          # Root component (25k+ lines)\\n├── index.tsx                        # React entry point\\n├── types.ts                         # TypeScript interfaces & types\\n├── vite.config.ts                   # Vite build configuration\\n│\\n├── bin/\\n│   └── stacks.cjs                  # CLI launcher script (384 lines)\\n│                                   # - Auto-downloads Electron\\n│                                   # - Manages MCP proxy startup\\n│                                   # - Version checking & updates\\n│\\n├── electron/\\n│   ├── main.cjs                    # Electron main process (200+ lines)\\n│   │                               # - Handles app lifecycle\\n│   │                               # - Vite dev server integration\\n│   │                               # - Window management\\n│   ├── mcp-proxy.cjs               # MCP proxy server (embedded)\\n│   │                               # - WebSocket bridge\\n│   │                               # - stdio MCP server management\\n│   │                               # - Server config persistence\\n│   └── pty-server.cjs              # PTY WebSocket server\\n│                                   # - Terminal emulation\\n│                                   # - Shell spawning\\n│\\n├── mcp/\\n│   ├── server.ts                   # MCP server implementation\\n│   │                               # - SQLite database interface\\n│   │                               # - Space/item CRUD tools\\n│   │                               # - Better-sqlite3 binding\\n│   └── proxy.ts                    # TypeScript MCP proxy\\n│                                   # - WebSocket handling\\n│                                   # - Server lifecycle\\n│                                   # - Tool/resource management\\n│\\n├── components/\\n│   ├── Canvas.tsx                  # Main canvas renderer\\n│   │                               # - Infinite pan/zoom\\n│   │                               # - Item selection & manipulation\\n│   │                               # - Connection rendering\\n│   ├── ItemRenderer.tsx            # Item rendering system\\n│   ├── NoteComponent.tsx           # Note editor\\n│   ├── StickyComponent.tsx         # Sticky note widget\\n│   ├── MediaComponent.tsx          # Image/video viewer\\n│   ├── FolderComponent.tsx         # Folder navigation\\n│   ├── BrowserComponent.tsx        # Embedded browser\\n│   ├── GhosttyComponent.tsx        # Terminal with Ghostty\\n│   ├── ContextToolbar.tsx          # Context menu system\\n│   ├── AIChat.tsx                  # AI conversation interface\\n│   ├── AIModal.tsx                 # AI response modal\\n│   ├── AIPromptPopup.tsx           # Inline AI prompt\\n│   ├── QuickGenerate.tsx           # Quick AI generation\\n│   ├── AutoArrangeButton.tsx       # Layout automation\\n│   ├── SettingsModal.tsx           # User preferences\\n│   ├── SearchModal.tsx             # Full-text search\\n│   ├── MediaViewer.tsx             # Media preview\\n│   ├── NoteViewer.tsx              # Note detail view\\n│   ├── SpaceOverview.tsx           # Space navigation tree\\n│   ├── ErrorBoundary.tsx           # Error handling\\n│   ├── Toolbar.tsx                 # Top toolbar\\n│   ├── SpaceToolbar.tsx            # Space-specific tools\\n│   ├── NameEditor.tsx              # Inline name editing\\n│   └── SpaceIndicator.tsx          # Current space display\\n│\\n├── hooks/\\n│   ├── useMCPClient.ts             # MCP client connection\\n│   │                               # - WebSocket management\\n│   │                               # - Server listing\\n│   │                               # - Tool invocation\\n│   ├── useAIWithTools.ts           # AI + tool integration\\n│   ├── useAutoSave.ts              # Auto-save persistence\\n│   ├── useSpaces.ts                # Space state management\\n│   └── useContentZoom.ts           # Content zoom hook\\n│\\n├── utils/\\n│   ├── storage.ts                  # Spaces persistence\\n│   │                               # - localStorage for metadata\\n│   │                               # - IndexedDB for media\\n│   ├── indexedDB.ts                # IndexedDB wrapper\\n│   │                               # - Media storage\\n│   │                               # - Blob handling\\n│   ├── layouts.ts                  # Auto-arrange algorithms\\n│   │                               # - Grid, Bento, Random layouts\\n│   │                               # - ELK graph layout\\n│   ├── database.ts                 # Database utilities\\n│   ├── imageAnalysis.ts            # Image processing\\n│   │                               # - Vision API integration\\n│   ├── imageGeneration.ts          # Image generation\\n│   ├── visionAnalysis.ts           # Vision analysis tools\\n│   ├── aiProvider.ts               # AI provider abstraction\\n│   │                               # - Supports Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini\\n│   ├── gemini.ts                   # Gemini-specific integration\\n│   └── exifExtractor.ts            # EXIF metadata extraction\\n│\\n├── lib/\\n│   └── mediaStorage.ts             # Media file handling\\n│                                   # - File storage system\\n│                                   # - Media ID generation\\n│\\n├── src/\\n│   ├── index.css                   # Global styles with Tailwind\\n│   │                               # - Custom animations\\n│   │                               # - Typography settings\\n│   └── electron.d.ts               # Electron type definitions\\n│\\n└── dist/                           # Built application\\n    ├── index.html\\n    ├── mcp/server.js               # Compiled MCP server\\n    └── mcp/proxy.js                # Compiled proxy\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. **Core Data Types** (types.ts)\\n\\n```typescript\\ntype ItemType = 'sticky' | 'note' | 'image' | 'video' | 'folder' | 'browser' | 'terminal'\\ntype LayoutType = 'grid' | 'bento' | 'random' | 'free'\\ntype SortOption = 'updated' | 'added' | 'name' | 'type'\\ntype FlowDirection = 'horizontal' | 'vertical'\\ntype ItemSpacing = 'compact' | 'comfortable' | 'spacious'\\n\\ninterface SpatialItem {\\n  id, type, x, y, w, h, zIndex, rotation\\n  content, color, metadata, linkedSpaceId\\n}\\n\\ninterface Space {\\n  id, name, parentId\\n  items, connections, camera\\n  layoutType, sortBy, flowDirection, itemSpacing\\n}\\n\\ninterface Connection {\\n  id, from, to\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 5. **Key Components & Features**\\n\\n#### **Canvas System** (Canvas.tsx + ItemRenderer.tsx)\\n- Infinite pan/zoom with mouse wheel\\n- Multi-select with Cmd+A\\n- Drag-and-drop repositioning\\n- Connection drawing between items\\n- Grid-based snapping (togglable)\\n- Item rotation and scaling\\n\\n#### **Item Types**\\n- **Sticky Notes** - Quick text snippets, customizable colors\\n- **Notes** - Larger text editor with markdown support\\n- **Images** - Image viewer with EXIF extraction\\n- **Videos** - Video player with metadata\\n- **Folders** - Hierarchical space navigation\\n- **Browser** - Embedded web content\\n- **Terminal** - Ghostty terminal with PTY backend\\n\\n#### **AI Integration**\\n- Multi-provider support (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google Gemini)\\n- Vision analysis for images\\n- Image generation capabilities\\n- MCP server bridge for external tools\\n- Contextual AI prompts\\n\\n#### **Auto-Arrange**\\n- Grid layout (220px cells with 40px gaps)\\n- Bento layout (mixed sizes, 3-column)\\n- Random scatter layout\\n- ELK graph-based layout\\n- Configurable spacing (compact/comfortable/spacious)\\n- Sort options (updated/added/name/type)\\n\\n#### **Storage & Persistence**\\n- **IndexedDB** - Media files (images/videos)\\n- **SQLite** (via MCP) - Persistent space data\\n- **localStorage** - UI state and preferences\\n- Auto-save with 5-second debounce\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 6. **MCP (Model Context Protocol) Integration**\\n\\n#### **MCP Server** (mcp/server.ts)\\n- Implements stdio transport\\n- SQLite database for space persistence\\n- Tools available to AI clients:\\n  - `list_spaces` - Enumerate all spaces\\n  - `get_space` - Load space data\\n  - `save_space` - Persist space changes\\n  - `create_space` - New space creation\\n  - `delete_space` - Space removal\\n  - And more...\\n\\n#### **MCP Proxy** (mcp/proxy.ts)\\n- WebSocket server on port 3099\\n- Bridges browser (frontend) to stdio MCP servers\\n- Manages server lifecycle (spawn/kill)\\n- Config persistence in `~/.stacks/mcp-proxy-config.json`\\n- Supports arbitrary external MCP servers\\n\\n#### **MCP Client Hook** (hooks/useMCPClient.ts)\\n- WebSocket connection to proxy (port 3099)\\n- Server listing and connection\\n- Tool invocation interface\\n- Resource and prompt support\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 7. **Electron Integration**\\n\\n#### **Launcher** (bin/stacks.cjs)\\n- Smart Electron caching in `~/.stacks/electron/`\\n- Auto-downloads Electron (~100MB) on first run\\n- Update checking against npm registry\\n- CLI commands: `--help`, `--version`, `--update`, `--clean`\\n- MCP proxy startup before Electron launch\\n- Signal handling (SIGINT, SIGTERM)\\n\\n#### **Main Process** (electron/main.cjs)\\n- Vite dev server management\\n- BrowserWindow creation and lifecycle\\n- PTY server initialization\\n- MCP proxy management\\n- Auto-reload on dev changes\\n\\n#### **PTY Server** (electron/pty-server.cjs)\\n- WebSocket server on port 3100\\n- Node-pty shell spawning\\n- Real-time terminal output streaming\\n- Supports zsh, bash, powershell\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 8. **Build & Deployment**\\n\\n#### **Build Scripts** (package.json)\\n```\\ndev              - Vite dev server (port 3000)\\nbuild            - Vite build + MCP TypeScript compilation\\nbuild:prod       - Production build with NODE_ENV=production\\nmcp:dev          - MCP server with tsx watch\\nmcp:build        - TypeScript compilation for MCP\\npackage:mac      - electron-builder for macOS\\n```\\n\\n#### **Build Output**\\n- React app → `dist/index.html` + assets\\n- MCP server → `dist/mcp/server.js`\\n- Electron → Self-contained macOS app\\n\\n#### **Configuration**\\n- **vite.config.ts** - Vite build (React, Tailwind, path aliases)\\n- **tsconfig.json** - Frontend TypeScript (ES2022, JSX, no emit)\\n- **tsconfig.mcp.json** - MCP server (ES2022, CommonJS output)\\n- **electron-builder config** - macOS/Windows packaging\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 9. **Key Utilities**\\n\\n#### **Storage System** (utils/storage.ts)\\n- `saveSpaces()` - Persists state with media deduplication\\n- `loadSpaces()` - Restores from IndexedDB/localStorage\\n- Media → IndexedDB (images/videos)\\n- Metadata → localStorage\\n\\n#### **Layouts** (utils/layouts.ts)\\n- `sortItems()` - Multi-key sorting\\n- `measureNoteContent()` - Dynamic grid sizing\\n- Layout algorithms using ELK for graph-based arrangements\\n- Constants for sizing and spacing\\n\\n#### **AI Providers** (utils/aiProvider.ts)\\n- Abstraction over multiple AI APIs\\n- Streaming response support\\n- Tool use integration\\n- Model selection logic\\n\\n#### **Image Analysis** (utils/imageAnalysis.ts)\\n- Vision API calls (Google/OpenAI)\\n- Color extraction\\n- Image metadata analysis\\n\\n#### **EXIF Extraction** (utils/exifExtractor.ts)\\n- Image metadata parsing\\n- Video duration detection\\n- Resolution extraction\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 10. **Recent Changes** (from git history)\\n\\n```\\nv0.2.9  - Scale drag tilt and lift by item size\\nv0.2.8  - Ghostty terminal integration with PTY backend\\n         - Add Ghostty terminal integration\\n         - MCP proxy architecture\\n         - Index-based storage system\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 11. **Project Statistics**\\n\\n**Source Code Files:**\\n- 48 TypeScript/TSX files (excluding node_modules)\\n- 27 React components\\n- 5 custom hooks\\n- 10 utility modules\\n- 2 MCP implementations\\n- 3 Electron modules\\n\\n**Key Metrics:**\\n- App.tsx: 25k+ lines (main application)\\n- Package size: ~5MB (with all dependencies)\\n- Runtime cache: ~/.stacks directory\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 12. **Architecture Patterns**\\n\\n1. **Spatial Canvas** - Infinite 2D grid with zoom/pan\\n2. **Hierarchical Spaces** - Folder-like navigation\\n3. **Event-Driven State** - React hooks + callbacks\\n4. **Bridge Architecture** - Electron ↔ Web ↔ MCP\\n5. **Lazy Loading** - Media stored in IndexedDB\\n6. **Auto-Persistence** - Debounced saves to storage\\n7. **Tool Integration** - MCP server for AI extensions\\n\\n---\\n\\nThis comprehensive architecture demonstrates a sophisticated desktop application that combines infinite canvas UI, AI integration, local-first storage, and extensible tool systems through the Model Context Protocol.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"text\": \"agentId: aa1a6b7 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\"\n  }\n]","toolStatus":"completed","toolDisplayMeta":{"displayName":"Agent","category":"native"},"isError":false,"turnId":"msg_01CojP7SAdZ5uiLSGhEXrnF2"}
